msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30066"
msgid "Increase clock speed of the emulated 3DO's 12.5MHz ARM60 CPU. Dramatically improves frame rates in many games, but increases performance requirements and in some cases has no effect (or may cause glitches)."
msgstr ""

